              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Horse, thrusting spear, hand weapon and partial plate armour. Combined Formation; may be included in a unit of Gendarmes. May be Veteran (+2 pts). (Armies of Chivalry p.59)</characteristic>
