              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Bow and hand weapon. May have light armour (+1 pt), a buckler (+1 pt), and stakes (+20 pts per unit). Chicken: Francs-archers fear any formed troops with a Leadership of 7 or more. Stakes. (Armies of Chivalry p.59)</characteristic>
