              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Each gun has a crew of three; two additional crew may be added (+10 pts each). Crewmen have hand weapon and light armour and may upgrade to heavy armour (+2 pts). Light artillery range 36", Strength 6. Artillery: up to one gun for every 1,000 army points (bought from the Infantry allocation). One model per gun may be upgraded to Master Gunner. May have one gun per 500 army points. One crewman per gun may be upgraded to a Master Gunner (+20 pts); up to two Master Gunners are allowed in the army (not enforced). (Armies of Chivalry p.59)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
