              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Each gun has a crew of three; two additional crew may be added (+10 pts each). Crewmen have hand weapon and light armour and may upgrade to heavy armour (+2 pts). Multi-barrelled artillery (ribauld/organ-gun): fires with a template at Strength 4, can stand &amp; shoot when charged. May have one gun per 500 army points (light and multi-barrelled together). (Armies of Chivalry p.59)</characteristic>
